# Architecture Reuse

The existing repository architecture is the source of truth.

## Reuse

Always reuse:

- navigation
- footer
- hero patterns
- cards
- grids
- buttons
- typography
- responsive utilities
- CSS variables

## Do Not

- redesign existing pages
- create duplicate components
- create alternate layouts when reusable ones exist
- introduce parallel CSS systems

## Implementation

Before creating anything new:

1. Search the repository.
2. Reuse an existing component if suitable.
3. Create a new component only when no reusable solution exists.

Consistency is more important than novelty.